<title>USA: DeepTech names Charles Darling president.</title>
<headline>DeepTech names Charles Darling president.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>DeepTech International Inc said Thursday Charles Darling, IV has joined the company as president and general counsel.</p>
<p>The company said the position was open before Darling was named to the post.</p>
<p>The company said Darling was previously a partner in the law firm of Baker &amp; Botts L.L.P. in Washington, D.C.</p>
<p>The company said he has been a director of DeepTech since February 1989, and also serves as a director of Leviathan Gas Pipeline Partners L.P.</p>
</text>
